 is faster than me.","That movie was more interesting than this one.","Today is hotter than yesterday.","She is more beautiful than ever."],"grammar":{"title":"Comparativos e Superlativos","rules":["<b>Adjetivos curtos</b> (1 sílaba): adicione <b>-er</b> / <b>-est</b>: big → bigger → biggest","<b>Adjetivos longos</b> (2+ sílabas): use <b>more / most</b>: beautiful → more beautiful","Para comparar: [A] + is + <b>adjective-er / more adj</b> + than + [B]","<b>Irregulares</b>: good → better → best | bad → worse → worst"],"table":{"headers":["Adjetivo","Comparativo","Superlativo"],"rows":[["big","bigger","the biggest"],["small","smaller","the smallest"],["good","better","the best"],["bad","worse","the worst"],["beautiful","more beautiful","the most beautiful"],["interesting","more interesting","the most interesting"]]}},"quiz":[{"q":"My car is ___ than yours. (big)","a":"bigger","opts":["more big","bigger","bigest","most big"]},{"q":"She is the ___ student in the class. (good)","a":"best","opts":["better","more good","goodest","best"]},{"q":"This test is ___ than the last one. (difficult)","a":"more difficult","opts":["difficulter","more difficult","most difficult","difficultier"]},{"q":"Today is ___ than yesterday. (hot)","a":"hotter","opts":["more hot","hoter","hotter","hottest"]},{"q":"He runs ___ than me. (fast)","a":"faster","opts":["more fast","fastest","faster","fastly"]}],"speak":["She is taller than me.","This is the best day ever!","English is more interesting than I thought.","He is faster than his brother.","That is the most beautiful place."],"lang":"en"}